Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shout it out, to save your spirit from breaking{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:45.13,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shout it out kokoro kudakenai youni{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.17,0:00:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Your friends are there for you{\i0}
