Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.63,0:00:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hey, you don't ever need to act tough{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.63,0:00:54.01,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}hora tsuyogari nante iranai itsudatte{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.05,0:00:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even when the darkness tries to tear you apart{\i0}
